tasks.brief:
Implementation constraints: Edit src/static/style.css. Add CSS rules inside the existing theme area. Do not modify any existing rules. No JavaScript changes.

Behavioral specification: 1. Add a base rule: .terminal-titlebar { display: none; }
2. Under the existing :root[data-theme="phosphor"] scope, add the following rules:
   - .terminal-titlebar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.5rem 0.9rem; background: oklch(0.12 0.02 155); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
   - .tl-dot { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; }
   - .tl-dot:nth-child(1) { background: oklch(0.65 0.2 25); }
   - .tl-dot:nth-child(2) { background: oklch(0.8 0.16 85); }
   - .tl-dot:nth-child(3) { background: oklch(0.75 0.2 145); }
   - .tl-title { font-size: 0.75rem; font-family: monospace; color: var(--muted-text); letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
   - .chat-panel { margin: 1.25rem; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 0 24px oklch(0.82 0.24 148 / 0.10); }

Acceptance condition: The file contains the base .terminal-titlebar rule with display: none, and the phosphor-specific rules for .terminal-titlebar, .tl-dot, .tl-title, and .chat-panel as specified, nested under :root[data-theme="phosphor"].
